  "description": "Roo Rev XL is the electric cargo bike built to carry more: more gear, more passengers, more adventures. Its durable, extra-long frame and spacious rear rack make room for bigger hauls or a passenger, while a powerful motor and long-lasting battery make it able to move up to 400 lbs with ease (even uphill!). This cargo ebike features a torque cadence sensor, puncture-protected tires, and a front suspension fork for smooth and steady riding. The upgraded Ananda complete e-system includes automatic lights with turn signals and brake function, a vivid color display with intuitive controls, a USB charging port, and more thoughtful tech to power your every errand. With extra frame space, it’s ready for baskets, panniers, or whatever your ride calls for. The accessory-ready rear cargo rack is compatible with the Thule Yepp 2 Maxi child passenger seat for rides to and from school, around the block, and weekend adventures.",
